# Plugin: Using Git Worktrees Adapter

Purpose:
  Adapt Superpowers using-git-worktrees skill for SDDRA C1 arm.

Source:
  D:\Tasks\ai_code\{project_name}\tmp\external-repo-audit\repo-01\skills\using-git-worktrees\SKILL.md

Original:
  Creates isolated workspace on new branch
  Runs project setup, verifies clean test baseline

Adapted for SDDRA:
  Context isolation instead of git worktrees:
    - AI works in .sdd/ context
    - Human works in project/ context
    - No direct code access until S1 approval

  Isolation layers:
    Layer 1: .sdd/ (AI context)
    Layer 2: .sdd/project/ (AI project model)
    Layer 3: project/ (human code)

  Branch strategy:
    - feature/* for new features
    - bugfix/* for bug fixes
    - hotfix/* for emergency fixes
    - Each branch linked to task ID

Usage:
  Referenced by:
    .sdd/chains/arms/code.sdd

  Triggers:
    - S1 arm approved
    - C1 arm execution
    - Code generation needed

State: Adapted
